ove red medium  rare too  married to this state and i would eat  this every day  she's married to the steak people seem  to be appreciating like the mixture of  the different herbs that's one thing  that i learned  in antony in the kitchen my first  cookbook that i worked really hard on  with mindy shameless plug for it  and to me let's do dinner i continue to  mix herbs together and a lot of recipes  in that book but anyways that's neither  here or there we're here to look at  steak free was definitely my favorite i  love  pickled onions i love the jalapeno it  just added that extra kick and it was i  love pickled shallots too  number four the taste was there for me i  liked how it was cooked  gordon ramsay  fair my favorite out of these four  dishes was number three it tasted  super fresh it was really nice and  tender  it is really tender so i guess the  judges enjoyed their steaks makeover  because anthony porowski takes today's  celebrity steak challenge i won yes  now i'll be watching my grilled cheese  recipe he uses brioche in his recipe and  he starts off by curving  so here's the deal adding mayo to each  slice of bread  you don't even really taste it when it's  there but it just acts as a really good  binder if you're putting something like  any type of ham or prosciutto or a  varico or whatever it is it just allows  it to cling more easily so that when you  first put your grilled cheese onto a  really hot pan it's not just gonna all  kind of like slide off it acts as a  really good binder then he tosses that  into a very well buttered pan very well  butter  slice it diagonally he insists and here  we have anthony perovski's grilled  cheese cutting grilled cheese diagonally  does taste better there's just something  so satisfying because if you cut it as  like a rectangle when you bite into it  it just makes it harder to get like more  of it in your mouth but if you cut it  diagonal if you start with a point it  goes deeper into your mouth and you're  abl